    "aboutLeiden": "About Leiden",
    "aboutLeidenDesc": "A city full of history, science and stories. Discover what makes Leiden so special.",
    "historyTitle": "History in brief",
    "historyP1": "Leiden is one of the oldest cities in the Netherlands, located on the Old Rhine. The city has a rich history dating back to Roman times.",
    "historyP2": "Leiden is world-famous as a university city (the oldest university in the Netherlands, founded in 1575 as a reward for brave resistance during the Spanish siege), as the birthplace of Rembrandt, and as the home of the Pilgrim Fathers before they departed for America.",
    "historyP3": "Today, Leiden is a vibrant city with a compact, historic centre full of canals, courtyards, museums and stories on every corner.",
    "practicalTipsTitle": "Practical tips",
    "tip1": "Leiden is best explored on foot or by bicycle. The centre is compact and largely car-free.",
    "tip2": "On Wednesdays and Saturdays there is a market on the Nieuwe Rijn and Botermarkt. The perfect combination with the Centre Route.",
    "tip3": "Leiden Centraal station is well connected to the rest of the Netherlands. From the station it's a 10-minute walk to the centre.",
    "tip4": "Most attractions are free to visit. Only museums charge admission.",
    "faqTitle": "Frequently asked questions",
    "faq1Q": "How does YourLocalCityGuide work?",
    "faq1A": "After purchasing the Leiden package, you get access to all routes and locations. At each location you can watch interactive videos, read stories and discover the city at your own pace.",
    "faq2Q": "How long do I have access?",
    "faq2A": "You have lifetime access to the Leiden package. All future routes and updates are included.",
    "faq3Q": "Can I use the routes offline?",
    "faq3A": "The routes and stories are available online. An internet connection is needed to load the videos and content.",
    "faq4Q": "Is it suitable for children?",
    "faq4A": "All routes are kid-friendly. The interactive videos are also fun and educational for children.",
